75 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (Science has always been more than a collection of facts to me. Finding fascinating stories behind scientific discoveries and the mind behind them has always inspired me.  It is a way of looking at the world, of asking questions, challenging what we think we know. Yet, somewhere between the laboratory and the pages of scientific journals, the wonder behind discovery can sometimes get lost. The people, the perseverance, the unexpected turns and the questions that drive scientific progress deserve to be told, too.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
