/E (Karl Deisseroth \(The Neuroscientist\) from Stanford University inserted the algal channelrhodopsin gene into the mammalian \(rat\) neurons. He used optical fibres to deliver blue light into living mice brains.When activated by blue light, channelrhodopsin opens ion channels and triggers electrical impulses.)
